{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons, no leveling up, no loot, no drama. Escapism for the modern age. Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) is a simple game where you can live out your secret fantasy of throwing a series of phones into a series of beautiful bodies of water. A meditative experience and cathartic way to deal with our attachment to technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/1b29fedc322da950bbf723c5f0f52863.avif?t=1751031994\" width=311 height=200 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/93c24bc6b9b49f1006669b7bbf6e34ac.avif?t=1751031994\" width=256 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arcade Mode has a simple scoring system and allows you to get competitive with friends. Toss your phones into a series of objectives as they float down the river, drift by your sea-scape or play some strange carnival games. Featuring a local leaderboard, so you can challenge your friends or get competitive with yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/93c24bc6b9b49f1006669b7bbf6e34ac.avif?t=1751031994\" width=256 height=262 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/55af1d24035506fdd40671634cd57c8d.avif?t=1751031994\" width=355 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Zen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen Mode is the ultimate escape. With no objectives or time limit, take a walk through the palm trees on a moonlit tropical shoreline or witness the northern lights among the pines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/c55fba1c3f1db950929c8edb23739007.avif?t=1751031994\" width=700 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of your rebellious acts in a series of beautiful environments. With none of the environmental hazards of throwing your real phone into real nature! <i>Throw Your Phone</i> is the responsible choice, and the ultimate simple satire simulator.<br><br>Featuring realistic water as the centerpiece around a series of stylized tranquil environments, this game is a digital vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/ddebc92216dcf57d5c6e108822b5fd02.avif?t=1751031994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras_big/ddebc92216dcf57d5c6e108822b5fd02.avif?t=1751031994 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fools Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/a69a50745e5a0fb99d010e0d7458818d886554bb.jpg"},{"name":"Dream Thrower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/162f5aba6c770a894a014c8f97246260aeafd284.jpg"},{"name":"Variety Minute","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/d70df517d8d1b029f2752574736dd2ed7481bc1c.jpg"},{"name":"Jukebox Junkie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/1997058bc0d7f09c1004897b12cd54945847983d.jpg"},{"name":"High Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/d70df517d8d1b029f2752574736dd2ed7481bc1c.jpg"},{"name":"Blow Up Your TV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/c8656699c79d98085d1cd7bf9d36be5cee0eb1c1.jpg"},{"name":"Pool Shark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/2db8141c60f0d32cb49bbbde5f063280a65abac9.jpg"},{"name":"Remodeling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/c8656699c79d98085d1cd7bf9d36be5cee0eb1c1.jpg"},{"name":"Score 20 Points","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/faef7b3265032383b452624500dbae32a2cfbe09.jpg"},{"name":"Double-0 Nothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2138740/e101eb8042ecce16f4ff0daa491705acbb8f8d4b.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2138740?t=1751031994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2138740?t=1751031994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751031994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751031994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons, no leveling up, no loot, no drama. Escapism for the modern age. Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) is a simple game where you can live out your secret fantasy of throwing a series of phones into a series of beautiful bodies of water. A meditative experience and cathartic way to deal with our attachment to technology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha