ronments. With none of the environmental hazards of throwing your real phone into real nature! <i>Throw Your Phone</i> is the responsible choice, and the ultimate simple satire simulator.<br><br>Featuring realistic water as the centerpiece around a series of stylized tranquil environments, this game is a digital vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras/ddebc92216dcf57d5c6e108822b5fd02.avif?t=1751031994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/extras_big/ddebc92216dcf57d5c6e108822b5fd02.avif?t=1751031994 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Billy Laurain"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138740/header.jpg?t=1751031994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2138740/1811958290/3fbe35634091d9fa441090ccd802d14dbee132b0/1751080773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748593994","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2138740/1811958290/3fbe35634091d9fa441090ccd802d14dbee132b0/1751080773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748593994","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2138740/1811958290/3fbe35634091d9fa441090ccd802d14dbee132b0/1751080773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748593994","id":257148249,"name":"Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean) - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148249/713b08f134a38625999931e7cbc2cd24ab287bdc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748593994"}],"name":"Throw Your Phone (Into The Ocean)","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default",