8d93/ss_d5161bba74af9d2186628c2ac57437efe6908d93.600x338.jpg?t=1751031994"}],"short_description":"As simple and as satisfying as it sounds, Throw your Phone! (Into the Ocean) A relaxing and meditative experience designed to calm your wild mind. With scored 'Arcade' mode and open-ended 'Zen' mode among multiple immersive environments.","steam_appid":2138740,"support_info":{"email":"billy@sandbargames.com","url":"http://sandbar.studio/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://sandbar.studio/"}